OL,3,GNEWSASculpted stone study could shed
OL,4,Anew light on lost kingdoms
OL,5,
OL,6,FA study of sculpted stones in
OL,7,Fsouth-east Scotland hopes to shed new
OL,8,Flight on the lost kingdoms of the area.
OL,10,FThe Society of Antiquaries of Scotland
OL,11,F(SAS) will fund initial fieldwork as
OL,12,Fpart of plans for a project documenting
OL,13,Fabout 200 fragments south of the
OL,14,FForth-Clyde line, most of which have
OL,15,Fnot been studied for over a century.
OL,17,FThe Sculpting Southern Scotland
OL,18,Fproject, co-ordinated by archaeologist
OL,19,FDr Christina Cowart-Smith, seeks to
OL,20,Fcollect images and data in order to
OL,21,Fexamine the story of the historically
OL,22,Fcontested border zone.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
